@ordering = http://localhost:8082
@key = exam-cesar-001

POST {{ordering}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{"customerId":"cesar","basketId":"cesar"}

### Repetir para verificar idempotencia
POST {{ordering}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{"customerId":"cesar","basketId":"cesar"}

### Sustituir ORDER_ID
GET {{ordering}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID

###
GET {{ordering}}/api/orders/customer/cesar

###
PATCH {{ordering}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Confirmed"}

### Debe fallar: carrito ajeno
POST {{ordering}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: foreign-basket-001

{"customerId":"cesar","basketId":"juan"}
